    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>Founded in 756 by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-i">Abd al-Rahman I</a>, a survivor of the Abbasid massacre of the Umayyad family.</li><li>It made <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/al-andalus">al-Andalus</a> an independent Islamic state and began the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mosque-cathedral-of-cordoba">Great Mosque of Córdoba</a> around 785.</li><li>After decades of revolt, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii">Abd al-Rahman III</a> reunited it and declared it a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliphate</a> in 929.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>Exiles expelled from <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cordoba">Córdoba</a> after the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/revolt-of-the-arrabal">Revolt of the Arrabal</a> of 818 later took part in the conquest of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/crete">Crete</a>, which became an Arab <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/emirate">emirate</a> for over a century.</p></aside>
    </section>

