in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cordoba">Córdoba</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">844</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vikings">Vikings</a> sack <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seville">Seville</a> and are defeated at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-tablada">Tablada</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">c. 880</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/umar-ibn-hafsun">Umar ibn Hafsun</a> begins his rebellion from Bobastro</span></li><li><span class="rf-year">928</span><span class="rf-text">Bobastro falls to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii">Abd al-Rahman III</a></span></li><li><span class="rf-year">929</span><span class="rf-text"><a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/abd-al-rahman-iii">Abd al-Rahman III</a> proclaims himself <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/caliphate">caliph</a></span></li></ol>
